# Normalise line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout hands Prettier CRLF files while it
# expects LF, so `pnpm format:check` failed on 40 files locally and would have
# failed the Windows leg of CI on the first push. Forcing LF in the working tree
# makes every platform agree.
#
# It matters beyond formatting: scripts/install.sh and the generated pre-commit
# hook are POSIX shell, and CRLF in either produces `\r: command not found` on
# Linux and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
